              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " syrup so every bite carries the cherry brandy flavour. Whip the cream to "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "stiff peaks",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "stiff-peaks"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " before spreading so it holds its shape when sliced. Serves 12."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The cake needs to chill for at least 4 hours before serving so the layers firm up and the flavours develop."
          }
        ]
